  <h1>ReMynd Chinese Literacy Observation Profile</h1><p class="meta">Parent Observation Form for Grades 3–12 — professional report: Approved</p>
  <p>Instrument 0.1.0; scoring parent-descriptive-domain-v0.1.0; language en-0.1.0; input revision 1600; record revision 1606; 2026-10-12T14:28:17.763Z</p>
  <p class="meta">Student identifier qAq76jraF1DAqWOyEtq8S; parent or caregiver . This record contains one parent or caregiver’s perspective in the home setting.</p>
  <p class="meta">This snapshot includes saved report, support plan, monitoring and linked follow-up records available at export time. Parent and teacher records are not combined.</p></header>
  <h2>Parent-reported observations in the home setting</h2><p>Classroom observations were not available for this profile.</p><dl><dt>grade</dt><dd>9</dd><dt>reason</dt><dd>1.对词语的准确性及广泛性不能很好的运用，写作与口头表达都如此。2.对一件事物的重点、次重点、非重点区分不够准确。3.对一件事物的先后顺序不能习惯性正确叙述。4.不爱主动表达，对词语的变通性较弱。5.对于一个字多次性的出错</dd><dt>script</dt><dd>simplified</dd><dt>setting</dt><dd>晚上</dd><dt>questions</dt><dd>1.如何有效帮助Nancy处理因不良家庭环境带给她的创伤。2.如何鼓励帮助Nancy在弱势情况下有信心达到好的水平</dd><dt>strengths</dt><dd>学过4年国学，能背诵一些文言文，但无法运用到写作中来。</dd><dt>activities</dt><dd>无此类家庭活动</dd><dt>relationship</dt><dd>父亲</dd><dt>home Languages</dt><dd>中文</dd><dt>spoken Variety</dt><dd>mandarin</dd><dt>assistance Mode</dt><dd>independent</dd><dt>completion Date</dt><dd>2026-10-12</dd><dt>observation End</dt><dd>2026-10-12</dd><dt>school Feedback</dt><dd>写作能力、词语运用能力较弱</dd><dt>current Supports</dt><dd>能帮助她解释一部份她无法理解的语句及部份语句相通的逻辑性</dd><dt>exposure History</dt><dd>写作能力较弱，受到中国小学6年义务教育，学了4年国学</dd><dt>parent Confirmed</dt><dd>yes</dd><dt>confirmation Date</dt><dd>2026-10-12</dd><dt>contact Frequency</dt><dd>Several times a week</dd><dt>observation Start</dt><dd>2026-08-03</dd><dt>access Information</dt><dd>无休学情况，小学语文成绩中偏下</dd><dt>reading Confidence</dt><dd>some_limits</dd><dt>writing Confidence</dt><dd>comfortable</dd><dt>unknown Information</dt><dd>近2年中文情况都未测评过</dd><dt>observation Language</dt><dd>中文</dd><dt>participation Impact</dt><dd>读写水平5年级.个人认为基础弱.与智力无关</dd><dt>school Feedback Source</dt><dd>家长</dd></dl>
  <p>Source-parent confirmation: Confirmed; date 2026-10-12; entered by user-admin-001.</p>
  <h2>Strengths and observations</h2><p>学习过3-4年国学</p><p>口头表达不够丰富，写作能力弱，学习过的词语，句子场景运用差。PW4.PW5.PR3.PGP6.PCL7.PCN1.P-SA1</p><p>良好家庭氛围缓慢沟通效果很好</p><p>怎么在不同场景下大方表达自身思想及观点，怎么在写作中运用学习过的知识</p><p>Ready for professional review</p>
  <table><thead><tr><th>Domain</th><th>Difficulty frequency</th><th>Rated / applicable</th><th>Coverage</th><th>Missingness</th><th>Separate impact</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Reading</th><td>2.3 of 5 — observed difficulty frequency</td><td>10 / 10 applicable; 10 original</td><td>100.0%</td><td>NO 0; NA 0; unanswered 0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dictation and transcription</th><td>2.0 of 5 — observed difficulty frequency</td><td>5 / 5 applicable; 5 original</td><td>100.0%</td><td>NO 0; NA 0; unanswered 0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Written expression</th><td>2.7 of 5 — observed difficulty frequency</td><td>7 / 7 applicable; 7 original</td><td>100.0%</td><td>NO 0; NA 0; unanswered 0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Chinese literacy patterns</th><td>2.3 of 5 — observed difficulty frequency</td><td>12 / 12 applicable; 12 original</td><td>100.0%</td><td>NO 0; NA 0; unanswered 0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">General performance</th><td>3.3 of 5 — observed difficulty frequency</td><td>6 / 6 applicable; 6 original</td><td>100.0%</td><td>NO 0; NA 0; unanswered 0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Attention and task engagement</th><td>2.7 of 5 — observed difficulty frequency</td><td>3 / 3 applicable; 3 original</td><td>100.0%</td><td>NO 0; NA 0; unanswered 0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Memory for learning</th><td>2.7 of 5 — observed difficulty frequency</td><td>7 / 7 applicable; 7 original</td><td>100.0%</td><td>NO 0; NA 0; unanswered 0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sequencing and organization</th><td>2.6 of 5 — observed difficulty frequency</td><td>5 / 5 applicable; 5 original</td><td>100.0%</td><td>NO 0; NA 0; unanswered 0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Oral language</th><td>2.3 of 5 — observed difficulty frequency</td><td>4 / 4 applicable; 4 original</td><td>100.0%</td><td>NO 0; NA 0; unanswered 0</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learning experience and wellbeing</th><td>2.4 of 5 —