      <div class="interpretation"><h4>Interpretation</h4><p>The response pattern is centered on 2 (Occasionally). 1 item was rated Sometimes, with no items rated Often or Almost always. This describes intermittent observations in this record, not a conclusion about other settings or whether support is needed. Separately, the respondent marked access impact as “Substantial restriction of participation or demonstration of learning”; this describes reported participation or demonstration of learning and is not part of the frequency mean.</p></div>
