      <p class="domain-narrative">7 applicable items received numeric ratings. Rating counts (1–5): 1: 0, 2: 2, 3: 5, 4: 0, 5: 0. The most common rating was 3 (sometimes). The descriptive mean is 2.7 of 5. No rated items were at 4 or 5; this is a description of this record, not a rule-out. Rated-item coverage was 100% of applicable items. Not observed: 0; not applicable: 0; unanswered: 0. These categories are kept distinct and are not treated as negative ratings. Separately recorded access impact: 3 of 3; impact is not averaged into the frequency ratings.</p>
